      "text": "LUPA PARA SA MGA MAGSASAKA!\n\nArtists for Just Peace presents 'GAPAS!', a film program featuring films about peasant workers, on February 11, from 7:00 to 9:00 PM, at Chapterhouse, Quezon City. The screenings will be followed by a discussion on the farmers' struggle, leading up to the 7th anniversary of the Rice Liberalization Law (RLL) protest.\n\nThe lineup includes:\n• ‘Bungkal’ by Lance Lozano\n• ‘Ha’antu Ka Maku’ by Janina Magundayao\n• ‘Saka Na’ by Cheska Marfori\n\nSign up here: https://t.co/C75WgfJwSn",
